    {
      "name": "Soul Shred",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "Creatures killed by an akashti are difficult to bring back to life or animate as undead. The akashti automatically attempts to counteract|CRB|3|counteracting|0 any attempt to resurrect or animate any creature that it has killed (counteract modifier +19, counteract level 5). If the akashti who slew the creature is itself slain, the creature can be brought back from death or become undead normally."
