      ],
      "entries": [
        "The akashti unleashes overwhelming sobs of despair. Creatures within 30 feet must attempt a DC 29 Will save or become stunned 1 (stunned 3 on a critical failure). The akashti can't use Stunning Despair again for 1d4 rounds."
